.SS "static \fBvoid\fP Assimp::SceneCombiner::AttachToGraph (\fBaiScene\fP * master, std::vector< \fBNodeAttachmentInfo\fP > & srcList)\fR [static]\fP"
Attach a list of node graphs to well-defined nodes in a master graph\&. This is a helper for \fBMergeScenes()\fP
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fImaster\fP Master scene 
.br
\fIsrcList\fP List of source scenes along with their attachment points\&. If an attachment point is nullptr (or does not exist in the master graph), a scene is attached to the root of the master graph (as an additional child node) @duplicates List of duplicates\&. If elem[n] == n the scene is not a duplicate\&. Otherwise elem[n] links scene n to its first occurrence\&. 
.RE
.PP

